2. PERMITTED USES: THE DIALECT SYSTEM
   - Anyone is permitted to create a "Dialect" of Iodine III to bypass local 
     network/organizational blocks.
   - You may modify the homepage layout, appearance, and local school branding.
   - CONDITION: Every Dialect MUST include a highly visible "Dialect for the 
     school of [Name]" notice on the homepage.
   - CONDITION: Every Dialect MUST retain the prominent "Powered by Iodine" 
     attribution at the top of the interface.
   - CONDITION: Every Dialect must contain Iodine Ads and Update Mirrors


2.5. Distros
   - Anyone is permitted to create a "Distro" of Iodine III to add custom games
